  "notes": "Inputs 1-8 are rear combo XLR/jack. Inputs 1-2 are duplicated on the front; a front connection takes priority. The front panel description calls the front inputs combo XLR/jack, the specifications call them 6.35 mm jacks; jacks are listed here. Line Outputs 1/2 (A) and 3/4 (B) are the speaker pairs, 5-10 are line outputs. Two ADAT optical pairs, S/PDIF coax, word clock out (BNC), IEC power (not listed). Optional power inputs and the Kensington lock are not listed. Routing: inputs reach the computer via USB and the outputs via the Focusrite Control 2 mixer; computer playback reaches all outputs.",
